# WET PAINT: the early courses pay well. With the foes gone, the demo
# driver's route round course 1 clears its goal by 40 points or more, and a
# normal run on it clears the goal comfortably.
seed 4
game wetpaint
wait 5
cheat course 1
cheat go
cheat nofoes
cheat autodrive
waituntil state == 4 2800
expect res_pass == 1
expect score >= 40
cheat autodrive
cheat course 1
cheat score 0
cheat go
botuntil state == 4 2800
expect res_pass == 1
expect score >= 15
